y cool stories while researching it and was really inspired to do better. • Her favorite article on the site by someone else is a tie between Top Ten Influential Firsts in History and Top Ten Lost Cities, both are incredibly well done.","sameAs":["https://www.toptenz.net"],"url":"https://www.toptenz.net/author/loni"}]}</script>
